    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0d050dc72df38d128881f20aeb29e3df.poster.avif?t=1753713391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0d050dc72df38d128881f20aeb29e3df.webm?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0d050dc72df38d128881f20aeb29e3df.mp4?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Nether Spirits blends a rich, story-driven solo roguelike deckbuilder with seamless co-op and PvP battles\u2014forge your path, perfect your deck, and reclaim your soul alone or alongside others.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solo, Co-op &amp; PvP</h2>Explore the Nether alone, join instant drop-in/drop-out co-op with anyone, or challenge others in 1v1 and 2v2 PvP\u2014whenever and wherever you want!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/5a7e93829f03e9b85dae57c4a1f505f3.poster.avif?t=1753713391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/5a7e93829f03e9b85dae57c4a1f505f3.webm?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/5a7e93829f03e9b85dae57c4a1f505f3.mp4?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Combat With New Strategic Depths</h2>Plan your turn in advance with the Timeline system: queue and chain cards for game-breaking combos, unleash a flurry of attacks at once, or  tweak plays mid-turn before they resolve.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0d050dc72df38d128881f20aeb29e3df.poster.avif?t=1753713391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0d050dc72df38d128881f20aeb29e3df.webm?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0d050dc72df38d128881f20aeb29e3df.mp4?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover The Secrets of the Nether</h2>Travel the vast expanse of the Nether and discover its dark history. Explore age-old ruins in search of lore and treasure, meet compelling characters and help them on their way, or venture into hostile forests thick with fog and mystery - there is no wrong path, only your own.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/1be34f0b96bf50b1ad1854f2de964af1.poster.avif?t=1753713391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/1be34f0b96bf50b1ad1854f2de964af1.webm?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/1be34f0b96bf50b1ad1854f2de964af1.mp4?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Interested? Join the Adventure NOW!</h2>Add Nether Spirits to your wishlist and join our Discord for the latest news and community chats!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/5a2a5ea8708d81af1077a1f72f5e8ccd.poster.avif?t=1753713391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/5a2a5ea8708d81af1077a1f72f5e8ccd.webm?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/5a2a5ea8708d81af1077a1f72f5e8ccd.mp4?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Note: All images shown are from a version still in development. The final product may differ from the materials presented here.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0d050dc72df38d128881f20aeb29e3df.poster.avif?t=1753713391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0d050dc72df38d128881f20aeb29e3df.webm?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0d050dc72df38d128881f20aeb29e3df.mp4?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Nether Spirits blends a rich, story-driven solo roguelike deckbuilder with seamless co-op and PvP battles\u2014forge your path, perfect your deck, and reclaim your soul alone or alongside others.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solo, Co-op &amp; PvP</h2>Explore the Nether alone, join instant drop-in/drop-out co-op with anyone, or challenge others in 1v1 and 2v2 PvP\u2014whenever and wherever you want!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/5a7e93829f03e9b85dae57c4a1f505f3.poster.avif?t=1753713391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/5a7e93829f03e9b85dae57c4a1f505f3.webm?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/5a7e93829f03e9b85dae57c4a1f505f3.mp4?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Combat With New Strategic Depths</h2>Plan your turn in advance with the Timeline system: queue and chain cards for game-breaking combos, unleash a flurry of attacks at once, or  tweak plays mid-turn before they resolve.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0d050dc72df38d128881f20aeb29e3df.poster.avif?t=1753713391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0d050dc72df38d128881f20aeb29e3df.webm?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/0d050dc72df38d128881f20aeb29e3df.mp4?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover The Secrets of the Nether</h2>Travel the vast expanse of the Nether and discover its dark history. Explore age-old ruins in search of lore and treasure, meet compelling characters and help them on their way, or venture into hostile forests thick with fog and mystery - there is no wrong path, only your own.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/1be34f0b96bf50b1ad1854f2de964af1.poster.avif?t=1753713391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/1be34f0b96bf50b1ad1854f2de964af1.webm?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/1be34f0b96bf50b1ad1854f2de964af1.mp4?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Interested? Join the Adventure NOW!</h2>Add Nether Spirits to your wishlist and join our Discord for the latest news and community chats!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/5a2a5ea8708d81af1077a1f72f5e8ccd.poster.avif?t=1753713391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/5a2a5ea8708d81af1077a1f72f5e8ccd.webm?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1607760/extras/5a2a5ea8708d81af1077a1f72f5e8ccd.mp4?t=1753713391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Note: All images shown are from a version still in development. The final product may differ from the materials presented here.",
